{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "55a3d3d1-c9fa-841f-bec1-a3bf611c7432",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T10:08:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. Yeah, it's Colleen Gallagher. I'm calling about trash and recycling, and I'm in a spot with wicked bad reception, so if I cut out just tell me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:06:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I'll holler if I lose you. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:06:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So my pickup was supposed to be yesterday and they skipped us. Second miss in a row, actually. Last week it was the same thing, the bin just sat there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, second miss in a row. Got it. Was it the trash, the recycling, or both?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the recycling this time. Trash got taken both times, it's the blue bin they [inaudible]."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up there. The blue bin they what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They left it. The blue bin is still at the curb, full, with the lid shut and everything. Nothing blocking it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:06:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so recycling not picked up, bin out and accessible. I'm writing that down. Do you have a number for me in case the crew needs to call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:07:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-nine-one, perfect. And what street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'd rather not say the address on this call. Can you just log it with the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:07:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm, they'll usually want a street to route it. I'll note it as a repeat miss and put a callback on it so someone can get the address from you directly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. Sorry, hang on one sec, my brother keeps texting me while I'm talking to you. He's been buzzing this whole call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:07:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I ignored him. Anyway, the other thing I wanted to ask. What do I do about the Christmas tree? When do they pick those up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:07:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good timing. The trees usually get collected in early January, separate from the regular route. Just put it at the curb with no bags, no lights, no tinsel, and no stand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bag, no decorations. Okay. And do I put it out on my normal day or a special day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:08:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd put it out on your regular day, since I don't have a separate date in front of me. The city website will have the January schedule if you want the exact weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:08:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll check that. [line breaks up] Sorry, did you say no stand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, no stand. Just the bare tree."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:08:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Thanks, Kevin. So someone's calling me about the recycling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:08:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll send it over now with your number. Should hear back within a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:08:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thanks. Happy New Year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:08:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Colleen. Take care."
    }
  ],
